Version 4
SHEET 1 7000 5000
RECTANGLE Normal 0 0 2000 900 2
TEXT 16 40 Left 3 ;1  PACK INPUTS: fuse, diode-OR (any pack can feed the avionics), TVS, input filter
TEXT 16 812 Left 2 ;J1 (Pack 1 input (from that pack's PDB tap)): 1=PACK1+, 2=GND
TEXT 16 844 Left 2 ;J2 (Pack 2 input (from that pack's PDB tap)): 1=PACK2+, 2=GND
TEXT 16 876 Left 2 ;J3 (Pack 3 input (from that pack's PDB tap)): 1=PACK3+, 2=GND
